<title>CAMEROON: SOCCER-CAMEROON AND ANGOLA DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CAMEROON AND ANGOLA DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>YAOUNDE 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cameroon and Angola drew 0-0 in</p>
<p>their World Cup African zone, group four qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 75,000.</p>
</text>
